MSFA DX7 synthesis core

Upstream: webaudiomodules/webdx7, src/c/msfa (Google MSFA with Dexed changes)
Source: https://github.com/webaudiomodules/webdx7
Related implementation: https://github.com/asb2m10/dexed
License: Apache-2.0. Original per-file copyright and license headers are retained.

HYBRID modifications:
- Direct, non-blocking MIDI, bank and program entry points added to SynthUnit.
- Standard equal-temperament-only tuning adapter added for this browser build.
- Empty ring-buffer implementation used; MIDI dispatch goes directly to the synth to avoid blocking in AudioWorklet.
- Added a C ABI wrapper for WASM bank memory, MIDI events and PCM rendering.
